      "statement": "EP-PPH-04..07 comprise the PPH v2 payments API: GET /pph/v2/payments/{paymentId} (150 TPS) for detail, GET /pph/v2/payments with clientId/rail/state/from/to/cursor filters (no account or beneficiary-name filter) for search, GET /pph/v2/payments/{paymentId}/history for state history (PPH processing-time timestamps), and POST /pph/v2/payments requiring an Idempotency-Key header for submission.",
